WEBVTT

00:00:01.125 --> 00:00:10.013
bib exports your .bib files as RIS, CSL JSON or BibTeX, ready for Zotero, Mendeley, pandoc or Word.

00:00:10.063 --> 00:00:17.749
The same entries as CSL JSON, the format pandoc and many reference managers read.

00:00:17.799 --> 00:00:28.221
export converts a Markdown draft: [@key] citations become \cite{key} in LaTeX, or a reference list in Word and HTML.
